                        <field name="dc_title">The S. Secretary of the Universal Office of the State tells me in the Royal Order of twenty and four of the past what follows [Printed text]: [The ambassador in the court of France and the consuls in that Kingdom, endorse the passports of the Spanish and foreign individuals who want to enter Spain and must notify the individuals who have to present the passports in the Captaincy General of the district where they are intervened and if they do not comply they will be forced to go back to the Border. </field>
